= Tulane University School of Medicine - Prompt 06

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Underrepresented Group
- Limit: 60 words
- Cycle used in this repo: 2024 archive on Admit.org
- Source: https://med.admit.org/secondary-essays/tulane-university
